  "summary_en": "UK statutory instrument amending the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 1992 to implement EU Directives 93/44/EEC and 93/68/EEC. It extends rules to safety components and machinery for lifting persons, introduces CE marking, revises essential health and safety requirements, and updates enforcement. It is the machinery safety precursor to robot safety regulation; no AI content.",
