   "Replaces the EC mark with CE marking and sets rules for proper affixation",
   "Adds essential health and safety requirements for lifting or moving persons",
   "Revises Schedule 4 list of hazardous machinery and Schedule 5 exclusions",
   "Requires notice before enforcement action over improper CE marking"
